<title>USA: N.M. 30 mln deal restructured, no price changes.</title>
<headline>N.M. 30 mln deal restructured, no price changes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it restructured New Mexico Mortgage Finance Authority's $30 million bond deal, but did not adjust any prices.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:</p>
<p>					    16,415,000*</p>
<p>					  SERIES E-2 (AMT)</p>
<p>REMARKETING</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NAF		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>						CONFIRMED</p>
<p>    DATED: 08/21/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		AMOUNT*   AMOUNT*   COUPON</p>
<p>			   (1/1)    (7/1)</p>
<p>1999			--	  25M    4.20  %</p>
<p>2000			25M	 25M    4.35  %</p>
<p>2001			25M	 30M    4.50  %</p>
<p>2002			30M	 30M    4.60  %</p>
<p>2003			30M	 35M    4.70  %</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>2004			35M	 45M    4.80  %</p>
<p>2005			40M	 50M    4.90  %</p>
<p>2006			50M	 50M    5.00  %</p>
<p>2007		     185M	190M    5.10  %</p>
<p>2008		     200M	200M    5.20  %</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>2009		     205M	215M    5.30  %</p>
<p>2010		     220M	225M    5.35  %</p>
<p>2011		     245M	250M    5.40  %</p>
<p>2017			--     2,575M    5.60  %</p>
<p>2029			--    11,180M    5.75  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 07/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 07/01/2009</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					     3,550,000*</p>
<p>					SERIES E-3 (NON-AMT)</p>
<p>REMARKETING</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NAF		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>					    CONFIRMED</p>
<p>    DATED: 08/21/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>07/01/2017		1,135M    5.45  %</p>
<p>07/01/2028		2,415M    5.60  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 07/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 07/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, July 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on August 21, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Company</p>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
